- Automated capacity-recovery architecture

## Key Architectural Learning
Capacity telemetry and live job monitoring answer different questions:

Capacity events explain what is consuming capacity.
Workspace Monitoring explains which operations are currently running.

Using both sources provides a more complete operational monitoring solution.

## Business Value
Faster capacity-incident detection
Clearer root-cause identification
Reduced dependency on manual investigation
Better visibility for Fabric administrators
Management-friendly operational reporting
Foundation for automated recovery and notification
